			"notes": "Built from `main` @ 2bf90c3 (merge of PR #1). Same code as v1.4.7-1.21.11; this build's embedded commit stamp matches the merged main branch.\n\n**Install:** put `sydney-1.4.7-1.21.11.jar` in `.minecraft/mods` with Fabric API 0.141.6+1.21.11, Sodium 0.8.14+mc1.21.11 and Lithium 0.21.4+mc1.21.11.\n\n**Included fixes**\n- Stress harness no longer overwrites the saved config with module defaults after a run.\n- Mixin audit resolves wildcard, constructor and nested-class targets and no longer reports false failures (0 issues / 86 files).\n- Config validator understands the inherited ChatNotify/Drawn/Bind settings and exits non-zero on unknown keys.\n- Docs corrected (tools/ paths, 65 enabled modules).\n\n**Verified**\n- Clean build, 0 warnings.\n- Full in-world module cycle with all 29 visuals enabled: 126 OK, 4 session-safety skips, 0 exceptions, 0 render-thread errors.\n- Boots on Fabric 1.21.11 / Loader 0.19.5 with Sodium 0.8.14 + Lithium 0.21.4.\n\nMinecraft 26.2 is not ported."
		},
